KelFront Brand Assets
=====================

This directory holds KelFront's own brand assets. They replace the
All-Rights-Reserved OpenFront assets that ship in upstream OpenFront's
proprietary/ directory, none of which are included in KelFront.

images/KelFrontLogo.svg, images/KelFrontLogoDark.svg, images/Favicon.svg,
images/KelFront.png, images/KF.png
  Original artwork created for KelFront. Regenerate with
  `node scripts/generateBrandAssets.mjs`.

sounds/music/menu-theme.mp3, sounds/music/gameplay.mp3,
sounds/effects/game-start-alert.mp3
  Original compositions synthesized for KelFront. Regenerate with
  `node scripts/generateAudio.mjs` (needs ffmpeg).

fonts/RussoOne-Regular.ttf
  "Russo One" by Jovanny Lemonad, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (see fonts/RussoOne-OFL.txt). Used unmodified.

Copyright (c) 2026 KelFront. The KelFront project owner chooses the license
for the original artwork and music above.
